  "id": "cbcl",
  "term": "CBCL",
  "definition": "CBCL stands for Child Behavior Checklist, a standardized questionnaire used to assess children’s and adolescents’ behavioral, emotional, and social functioning. It is completed from parent or teacher reports and is designed to capture a broad range of problem areas, including attention and behavior difficulties.",
